      "id": "claim_c2b6b306d51742b485234367c7fca034",
      "statement": "The Bitwarden ESO Provider authenticates to Bitwarden using credentials from an existing Kubernetes Secret named bitwarden-cli, which maps BW_PASSWORD, BW_USERNAME, and BW_HOST secret keys to the corresponding provider authentication parameters.",
